<title>NORWAY: Norway expands t-bill by 5.0 billion crowns.</title>
<headline>Norway expands t-bill by 5.0 billion crowns.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's central bank said on Friday the Finance Ministry was expanding treasury bill SS45 by five billion crowns.</p>
<p>The bill matures on Dec. 17 this year.  </p>
<p>The amount will be issued at an auction with final date for tenders at 0900 GMT on Monday. Settlement is two days later.</p>
<p>The bill was issued last month with five billion crowns going to the market and 500 million crowns reserved for the central bank. It has a nominal interest rate of 4.30 percent.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
